        <mxCell id="rule" value="&lt;b&gt;Precedence.&lt;/b&gt; azd environment value → its default in azd.parameters.json → the Bicep default. Script tunables: demo-ids.local.json key → the default in code. CLI flags (e.g. --split, --extract) override both for that run. Every variable, default and consumer is listed in docs/12." vertex="1" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFBEB;strokeColor=#B7791F;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=13;fontColor=#323130;align=left;verticalAlign=top;arcSize=4;spacing=10;">
